	(text_box "Active-low input optoisolators. Inputs to chassis 0V.\n\nAssume 50% CTR w.c.\nVf = 1.2V @1mA\nLowest battery = 10V\n\nCircuit CTR:\nIf = (10V-1.2V)/1mA = 8.8k. \nLower closest 8k2 = 1.07mA\nIc = 3.3/10k = 330uA\nCTRc = 0.33/1.07 = 30.8%\n\nOpto is always in saturation\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
